/div&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;这一拒绝让峰会的东道主土耳其脸红了，对联合国的共识模式是否能够解决导致极端天气事件比科学模型预测的更严重、更频繁的问题的根本原因产生了根本性的怀疑。多边主义&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/9yd_dK9aLHmMIl8tfkRZxx7Q5u9tf_m8nlzxAr2n09m1ev737XjeiR3s8wEgxdQFuJWiJE1lg8Yy-QsvWYbvLBx3U0w1NFgLqXP1iXSKEwL1t3a_f64LM9H5bf0Mfuq8et1nzaKc4tQdPsGooUj4PdzvqJPFb1Vrshjh9DgTHvkCJCuUbJbxcndODFJssL7X2E0dsupzVGPgMcfirK6U_rcnBZJWHaT3hBbB7kXC1ET4CtH1y4Rv2-vdzqNwcVHMXaOEJukSINg4wTtwg7nIgMbIO_LpIjmzdyzLYB5ur5yHaJtWTe6laD4rEyGSG3juEbcAwHurUA53qUkpHFUdNY2emMzgJwQRf0ldUGXNyoMnPOua-JqZ-XirAz9DODfMU_lATlr4VFildiePmLeBExy7I9BwHmLpNWP2bXjEe9SYkHblvRDtcPIOep2neOVuQvTVQkhAke9ef0bUs3omQt7B8PFXuEQ544Tmcf7JFqM5WRnBF0RRm2RB0GL2UfhBGJgjTw1riCtsItqtDJ8UPGIJenXwvPebphnnLgovmiKEzA/ruqhl8PF65BaH7g5CsJ7y6tQheIqgmx-/26" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="COP31的失败表明气候外交的断层线正在扩大"&gt;再次受到打击&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;所有浮华和引人注目的公告都无法掩盖这样一个事实： &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/8FB3Xq5o0PMdkMfrzpgggLbHY6_FNJHGm7PVewWW5vyaVom544xbu1AYwAJWYPGHqt5P5mdeQ8zk4oKGd4PNHiATykY8pcpbOqChCXU_7rMigX8OJkEVR-2dLgqzOlyjDnQp94MaEWax97XXWJs65RNBWLn9yMkBMjeBmsz7u0icl5mxkYxj6rbIso8wzTGziiOIqjddlF2U3kxpmySPmnnKOtW0z8dno_J9EblT42mpxGyKQTko-cFunUmbYZh5j0vAaYEj3jtEOiv3m_T-GJZoNLFA07XpCnuOx5tJo7cj0HIsQkQ9KiYqyM6e5tvLP1_9uwRQoiwib_3Orohhv67q60HpER3j_dzA-AQ5XZo1Lgv2YSmhKLe0b1popYIdAiHKOnfCgI6NLdTxU8AiBD49xrop3CcoAQoTPsGyYIuTA1oWP-P8XlBGWS1SY-SKVEHeEF55dKy1GYguE8w0zM9nj3c6i0O21Sr4H1nlApcOu9sIdWQ_uO1GQZElIAgXxz2OfTu58uCIKkTnioV3zEPP4memXkFBONeOtydnSNmT9QA8/Ra-NPikcmFnaOhoeahcNTK70qttuyP49/26" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="当气候峰会甚至不能说“化石燃料”时，它就失败了"&gt;全球在应对气候变化问题上的分歧&lt;/a&gt;正在日益扩大。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;代表们&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/sLOYVftwXQr-auPPM68HgcOdQM-Ef5x0q9145lI